  {
    "id": "88559c8d-b33d-4a47-86c9-284dbd6c488b",
    "lang": "en",
    "field": "body",
    "model": "item",
    "stale": true,
    "value": "<p>You can find us at <strong>Ter 35, 3333 Ljubno ob Savinji</strong>, on a sunny plateau above the valley.</p><p><strong>Recommended route:</strong> take the main road through the Savinja Valley (road 428) and, before Ljubno, in the village of <strong>Juvanje</strong>, turn off the main road <strong>towards Ter</strong> — if you are coming from the direction of Mozirje, turn <strong>right</strong>. From here, it is approximately another 4 km (just over 9 minutes): the road is paved, with only <strong>the final kilometre being a maintained gravel road</strong>.</p><p>Follow this route even if your navigation suggests another one — the other roads to us are steeper and have more gravel. The recommended route is comfortable for any car.</p><p>If you are unsure, give us a call — we will guide you right to the door.</p>",
    "record_id": "df403474-2f7a-4c0a-8e2e-f8128da575b9",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-24T06:12:50.507509+00:00",
    "source": "<p>Najdete nas na naslovu Piknik prostor Gril-<strong> 3333 Ljubno ob Savinji</strong>, na sončni planoti nad dolino.</p><p><strong>Priporočena pot:</strong> po glavni cesti skozi Savinjsko dolino (cesta 428) se pred Ljubnim, v naselju <strong>Juvanje</strong>, odcepite z glavne ceste <strong>proti Teru</strong> — če prihajate iz smeri Mozirja, zavijete <strong>desno</strong>. Od tu vas čaka še približno 4 km vožnje (dobrih 9 minut): cesta je asfaltirana, le <strong>zadnji kilometer je urejen makadam</strong>.</p><p>Držite se te poti, tudi če navigacija ponudi drugo — ostale ceste do nas so strmejše in z več makadama. Priporočena pot je udobna za vsak avtomobil.</p><p>Če ste v dvomu, nas pokličite — usmerimo vas do vrat.</p>",
    "inCurrentSource": true
